# Autotools cross "file" for NextBSD amd64: a CONFIG_SITE script, sourced by
# every configure that build-gnustep-support.sh runs for this arch. configure is also
# given --build=<host triple> --host=x86_64-unknown-freebsd and --with-sysroot.
#
# Per-arch answers to configure checks that would have to run a target program
# go here, each with its reason. Answers common to both arches go in common.site.

gs_triple=x86_64-unknown-freebsd

. "${GS_CROSS:?}/autotools/common.site"
